{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca5 Steal Enemy Powers and Forge Your Own Battle Deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856480/extras/24b265e2c454ef2c4decf24afa09a377.poster.avif?t=1774453594\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856480/extras/24b265e2c454ef2c4decf24afa09a377.webm?t=1774453594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856480/extras/24b265e2c454ef2c4decf24afa09a377.mp4?t=1774453594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the ultimate soul-sorcerer, you\u2019re trapped in an endless dungeon, seeking a way to escape. Absorb the power of shadows, seal it into cards, and challenge every formidable enemy that stands in your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card offers a clear and direct effect \u2014 no complex keywords or forced archetypes. Create synergies freely through your imagination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple yet exciting mechanics \u2014 feel the thrill of fast-paced combat within just ten minutes of play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856480/extras/770c0afcade4161f2c0e2fa041b7582e.poster.avif?t=1774453594\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856480/extras/770c0afcade4161f2c0e2fa041b7582e.webm?t=1774453594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856480/extras/770c0afcade4161f2c0e2fa041b7582e.mp4?t=1774453594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a1\ufe0f <strong>Draw to Switch Skills \u2014 Experience True No-Cooldown Combat</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856480/extras/13c2d7c34d07ca2ec4a6fbef4a9d1fba.poster.avif?t=1774453594\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856480/extras/13c2d7c34d07ca2ec4a6fbef4a9d1fba.webm?t=1774453594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856480/extras/13c2d7c34d07ca2ec4a6fbef4a9d1fba.mp4?t=1774453594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep in-run progression ensures every challenge feels fresh. Experiment with different elemental combinations and unlock powerful Dual Passives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine effects through the Rune Enchant system to craft unique and powerful cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each draw lets you choose three skills to equip \u2014 unleash them freely with limited uses and zero cooldowns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master &quot;Instant Cast&quot; skills to chain unexpected and stylish combos without interrupting other actions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde5 Customize Your Starting Deck and Appearance \u2014 Every Run Is a New Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856480/extras/1450f6a5624b873aaf4d142399994366.poster.avif?t=1774453594\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856480/extras/1450f6a5624b873aaf4d142399994366.webm?t=1774453594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856480/extras/1450f6a5624b873aaf4d142399994366.mp4?t=1774453594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No redundant meta progression. You start every run at full power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect new cards and add them to your starting deck for fresh experiences every time. Under clear limitations, every challenge remains unpredictable, preserving the core randomness and excitement of a true roguelike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new outfits and styles to express yourself and keep the adventure feeling fresh.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3856480?t=1774453594","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856480/6d53f4dbdffe380a14db8bc4a415330ed9129453/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774453594","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856480/c3e605a0b3beea0ce1222c88994da42735e53587/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774453594","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856480/c3e605a0b3beea0ce1222c88994da42735e53587/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774453594","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support"